OL,3,GNEWSANo collusion in sectarian killing
OL,4,Abut 'wrongful omissions' in police
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn inquiry into the sectarian murder of
OL,8,FRobert Hamill has found police officers
OL,9,Fwho were in a vehicle near the attack
OL,10,Fdid not condone or collude with the
OL,11,Fattackers.
OL,13,FThe report, published on Monday,
OL,14,Fhighlighted multiple wrongful omissions
OL,15,Fin the subsequent murder investigation
OL,16,Fincluding a failure to properly search
OL,17,Fthe home of a key suspect.
OL,19,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,20,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,21,FPortadown, County Armagh in 1997.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
