OL,3,GNEWSANo collusion in sectarian killing
OL,4,Abut 'wrongful omissions' in police
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry concluded in 2009 and its
OL,8,Freport was completed in 2011 but the
OL,9,Ffindings could not be published until
OL,10,Fthree prosecutions in connection with
OL,11,Fthe case concluded.
